From 90717545d91cc146c61413c1aa74ed9085973dbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: z4rivers <zachary4rivers@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Mar 2026 16:47:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 56/68] feat(4.1-01): integrate MuninnDB into brain MCP server
 (13 tools)

- Dual-write in capture: MuninnDB write after Postgres (best-effort, non-fatal)
- Parallel search: pgvector + MuninnDB ACTIVATE with source labels [pgvector]/[muninn]
- New activate tool (#13): dedicated cognitive retrieval with score components
- MuninnDB failures never block Postgres operations (graceful degradation)
- Updated module docstring: 12 tools -> 13 tools

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
